n base?","a":"Yes — it holds two of Mexico''s most serious luxury resorts on one estate. Costa Palmas fronts a rare swimmable Cabo-side beach (3 km) with the Four Seasons and Amanvari, 45 minutes from SJD, so couples get calm water plus branded ultra away from the corridor crowds.","source":"costapalmas.com, 2026-07-04","si_tag":"romance"},{"q":"When can I see whales in the Sea of Cortez here?","a":"Late December to early April, with the blue-whale peak Feb–Apr. Gray, humpback, blue and fin whales all pass offshore, on day tours or private charters out of the East Cape — one of Earth''s richest whale seas.","source":"oceanicsociety.org, 2026-07-04","si_tag":"expedition"},{"q":"When is the fishing and the wind best on the East Cape?","a":"Two opposite seasons: billfish and dorado peak May to early November in glass-calm water, while the El Norte wind turns Los Barriles into a 15–25 kt kite and windsurf arena Dec–March. Pick the season for the sport you came for.","source":"marinalife.com / middlecasa.com, 2026-07-04","si_tag":"ocean"}],"seo":{"meta_title":"East Cape Baja (Costa Palmas) Travel Guide — Fishing, Whales & Ultra-Luxury | TravelWell.World","meta_description":"The wild Sea-of-Cortez side of Cabo: Costa Palmas ultra (Four Seasons + Amanvari), world-class marlin/dorado sportfishing, Los Barriles kite season, whales Dec–Apr, and the Cabo Pulmo reef.","slug":"east-cape-mexico","primary_keywords":["East Cape Baja","Costa Palmas","East Cape sportfishing","Los Barriles kiteboarding","Four Seasons Los Cabos Costa Palmas"],"long_tail":["best time to fish East Cape Baja","whale watching Sea of Cortez December April","Amanvari Aman Costa Palmas","luxury villa rental East Cape","Cabo Pulmo diving from Los Barriles"],"search_language":"es-MX","local_keywords":["Cabo del Este Baja","Costa Palmas Los Cabos","pesca deportiva Cabo del Este","kitesurf Los Barriles El Norte","avistamiento de ballenas Mar de Cortés","buceo Cabo Pulmo","villas de lujo Cabo del Este"],"hreflang"